        {
          "exampleId": "w:film#e-5738a39aa5837f91",
          "text": "Already, a number of films, including “Water for Elephants,” “The Hangover Part II” and “Zookeeper,” have drawn the anger of activists who say the creatures acting in them haven’t been treated properly.",
